"<div class="space-y-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6"><p class="text-milk/80 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4"><img src="/blogs/hi/assets/hello.gif" alt="/blogs/hi/assets/hello.gif" class="rounded-xl max-w-full h-auto my-4" loading="lazy"/></p>
<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-dark flex gap-3 rounded-2xl p-6 contain-content items-start justify-start"><div class="absolute pointer-events-none inset-0 text-[20rem] *:size-full opacity-20 scale-900 blur-xl flex items-center justify-center"><img src="/blogs/hi/assets/glorp-skin.jpg" alt="/blogs/hi/assets/glorp-skin.jpg" class="rounded-xl max-w-full h-auto my-4" loading="lazy" width="40px"/></div><div class="shrink-0 relative text-3xl leading-none"><img src="/blogs/hi/assets/glorp-skin.jpg" alt="/blogs/hi/assets/glorp-skin.jpg" class="rounded-xl max-w-full h-auto my-4" loading="lazy" width="40px"/></div><div class="relative flex-1 w-full h-max *:first:mt-0 *:last:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:leading-relaxed"><p class="text-milk/80 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">Hello, I&#x27;m Emin Erçoban a <strong class="text-milk font-bold">Product Designer &amp; Developer</strong> in Turkey/Antalya. My mission is to enhance projects, applications with creative design and modern technologies.</p></div></div>
<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-milk mb-6 mt-8 first:mt-0 leading-tight" id="about-me"><a href="#about-me" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="anchor-link">🪐 About Me</a></h1>
<p class="text-milk/80 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">I&#x27;m currently working as a freelancer alongside my best friend on platforms like Fiverr and Bionluk, where we deliver <strong class="text-milk font-bold">websites, web applications, desktop and mobile applications</strong>. I also experianced in <strong class="text-milk font-bold">UI/UX design, graphic design, and brand identity development.</strong></p>
<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-milk mb-6 mt-8 first:mt-0 leading-tight" id="experience"><a href="#experience" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="anchor-link">💼 Experience</a></h1>
